    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice is a disaster when it comes to asking women out. But when she adopts a dog from the shelter, she wasn't expecting to be knocked over by an absolutely cute lady who makes her want to try. When their dogs help them meet again, Alice starts to fall for Sophie. Will she be able to get her feelings across? Read on in this fluffy romance set in Toronto, featuring the best wingdogs, Dani and Apple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Apple</i> &quot;Awwww Alice is being flirty!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dani</i> &quot;Is that what you call it?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Apple</i> &quot;Maybe we'll call it an attempt.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kinetic visual novel (no choices) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ~25,000 word story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the point of view from the dogs helping their lovestruck owners!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original sprite art and CGs (cutscenes) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam achievements</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice is a disaster when it comes to asking women out. But when she adopts a dog from the shelter, she wasn't expecting to be knocked over by an absolutely cute lady who makes her want to try. When their dogs help them meet again, Alice starts to fall for Sophie. Will she be able to get her feelings across? Read on in this fluffy romance set in Toronto, featuring the best wingdogs, Dani and Apple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Apple</i> &quot;Awwww Alice is being flirty!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dani</i> &quot;Is that what you call it?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Apple</i> &quot;Maybe we'll call it an attempt.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kinetic visual novel (no choices) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ~25,000 word story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the point of view from the dogs helping their lovestruck owners!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original sprite art and CGs (cutscenes) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam achievements</p></li></ul>",
